OL,3,GNEWSADalian Atkinson fund opens to     
OL,4,Acommunity groups                       
OL,6,FCommunity groups have been invited to  
OL,7,Fapply for a share of #18,000 from a    
OL,8,Fcharity fund that was set up in memory 
OL,9,Fof footballer Dalian Atkinson.         
OL,11,FThe Dalian Atkinson Legacy Fund was set
OL,12,Fup by his family in partnership with   
OL,13,FShropshire Community Foundation, and   
OL,14,Fhopes to provide accessible sporting   
OL,15,Fopportunities for young people.        
OL,17,FIn homage to the former Aston Villa    
OL,18,Fstriker's number 10 shirt, the grant is
OL,19,Fbeing offered to 10 community          
OL,20,Forganisations across Shropshire,       
OL,21,Fincluding Telford & Wrekin.            
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
