OL,3,GNEWSADalian Atkinson fund opens to     
OL,4,Acommunity groups                       
OL,6,FAtkinson, who was suffering from a     
OL,7,Fserious illness which had affected his 
OL,8,Fphysical and mental health, died in    
OL,9,Fhospital in 2016 after he was tasered  
OL,10,Fand kicked by police outside his       
OL,11,Ffather's home in Telford.              
